        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daniel Boone\n- Places: Arcadia, Tennessee; Jenkins, Kentucky; Tennessee; Kentucky\n- Events: Green-Jones War\n- Infrastructure: Daniel Boone's trail; National Road; WKVG\n\nFacts:\n- In July 1775, Daniel Boone's trail ran through Arcadia, Tennessee.\n- Daniel Boone's trail leads into Kentucky.\n- Daniel Boone's trail was near one of the locales of the Green-Jones War.\n- Daniel Boone's trail was turned down to become the National Road.\n- WKVG is licensed to Jenkins, Kentucky.",
